  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "Universal Rules Updates",
    "summary": "When a TRANSPORT model made a normal move earlier that turn, use an assault disembark move whenever another rule lets the disembarking unit declare a charge. If the TRANSPORT model made an advance move during that turn and a rule lets the unit get out, use a shock disembark move. Each substitutes for the ordinary disembark move.",
